{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d2673e0edcd66e327478de683eaf2867ef602d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24745c800ec409802436f5bca5bf54c13d894c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[4]{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5ee894ad5966c496ec16f45b42831232b423101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt[7]{12}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2\\sqrt[7]{12}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\sqrt[7]{32}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\sqrt[12]{32}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }2\\sqrt[12]{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"507\" height=\"21\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d2673e0edcd66e327478de683eaf2867ef602d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24745c800ec409802436f5bca5bf54c13d894c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[4]{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50ca2bc2a133bede9b8e6e107ebaa195172a39b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\frac{2}{3}}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/d/64db892535365f866adff8b81f279444b22fb232.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\frac{3}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"19\" />, so their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/e/b2e52c269eaa208c7adf83298ab142dd64c38a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\frac{17}{12}} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 2\\sqrt[12]{32}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"143\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p